************************************************* BEGIN OF TaySim.par **************************************************
                                                                                                         
 NOTE : NONE OF THE LINES IN THIS  PARAMETER FILE  SHOULD BE DELETED.  THE DATA ENTERED 
        AFTER THE DOUBLE-COLON(::) IS ONLY READ BY THE PROGRAM, IF ENTERED ACCORDING TO 
        FORMAT SPECIFIED. IT IS ADVISED NOT TO MODIFY THE COLUMN LABELS. 
                                                                                                                                                                            
(U01) Input C-Coefficient filename prefix            [A08] :: OLDE0001
(U02) Crystal Structure                              [I02] :: 01
(U03) Type of relaxations to be imposed in TAYLORS   [I02] :: 00
(U04) Output filename prefix                         [A08] :: NEWE0001
(U05) Info to put in output files                    [A40] :: ELEMENT NUMBER=0001; INCREMENT=00000002;
(U06) Sample symmetry to be imposed(IMAG,IDN) [I02,2X,I02] :: 01  02
(U07) Macroscopic strain to be imposed              [F8.5] :: 0.05
(U08) Number of deformation steps                    [I02] :: 01
(U09-U11) Prescribed strain mode            [3*3(F9.5,1X)] ::   1.00000   0.00000   0.00000
                                                                0.00000  -0.50000   0.00000
                                                                0.00000   0.00000  -0.50000
(U12) Advanced options (def:IDM=4,PHI0=7.0)  [I02,1X,F5.2] :: 04  7.00

************************************************** END OF TaySim.par ***************************************************